					"documentation": "# Manage Report Flow of events\n\n## Basic Flow\n\n1. *Admin* clicks a button.\n2. If the clicked button in **Ban** the *system* set **Sale status** on *ADMIN_REPORTED* and set **Treated** as true.\n3. Else if clicked button is **Decline** the *system* remove the **Report** and set **Sale status** on *ON_SALE*.\n## Alternative flow \n1. The **Report** is not found.\n2. The **Report** has been already treated.\n",
