					"documentation": "# Login Flow of events\n\n## Basic Flow\n\n1. *Non-registered* enters the **username**.\n2. *Non-registered* enters the **password**.\n3. *System* displays successful login.\n\n\n## Alternative flow (Continue as Non-registered)\n1. Username and password do not match.\n2. Username does not exist.\n",
