					"documentation": "amou# Show Movements Flow of events\n\n## Basic Flow\n1. *Registered* clicks Show Movements button.\n2. *System* displays ShowMovementsGUI.\n1. *Registered* select the **type**.\n2. *System* displays the information associated to **Movements** with inserted **type** (**type**, **date**, **amount** and **amount after**).  \n\n\n## Alternative flow\n1. There are no active **Movements** with selected **type**, the message describe that are not movemets to be displayed.\n\n",
