					"documentation": "# Make a Complaint Flow of events\n\n## Basic Flow\n\n1. *Registered* clicks in make a complaint button.\n2. *System* creates a **Complaint** with inserted message and assigns the **Complaint** to the **Registered** and to the **Sale**.\n\n\n## Alternative flow (Complaint is not created)\n1. The message field is empty. System informs the *Registered*.\n"
