					"documentation": "# Manage money Flow of events\n\n## Basic Flow\n\n1. *Registered* clicks Manage Money button.\n2. *System* displays a GUI to insert the **amount** and the **type**(Deposit or Withdraw).\n3. *Registered* inserts the **amount**, the **password** and selects the **type**.\n4. *System* checks if the **password** is correct.\n5. *System* sets the new balance to the **Registered**.\n6. *System* creates a **Movement** with selected **type** and inserted **amount** and assigns the **Movement** to the **Registered**.\n\n## Alternative flow (Movement is not created and balance do not change)\n1. The type is not selected. System informs the *Registered*.\n2. The amount is not inserted. System informs the *Registered*.\n3. There is not enough money to withdraw.\n4. Inserted money is not a number.\n5. Inserted password is incorrect.\n",
					"attributes": [
						{
							"_type": "UMLAttribute",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGdJBoDdAdsXyU=",
							"_parent": {
