					],
					"documentation": "# Manage Complaint Flow of events\n\n## Basic Flow\n\n1. *Admin* clicks a button.\n2. If the clicked button in **Decline** the *system* set **Treated** as true.\n3. Else if clicked button is **Accept** the *system* set **Treated** as true. *System* also, remove the **Sale**, set **new balance** on the *seller* and on the *buyer* and create for each a **Movement**.\n\n## Alternative flow \n1. The **Complaint** is not found.\n2. The **Complaint** has been already treated.",
